    [3572]={name="Daryl's Shortsword",quality=2,ilvl=17,reqLevel=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Hunter's Challenge'. Starts with Daryl the Youngling in Loch Modan. Objective: Kill 5 Elder Mountain Boars and return to Daryl the Youngling in the Farstrider Lodge within 12 minutes.",zone="Loch Modan",questName="A Hunter's Challenge",lore="ath, is it? I can tell you're bursting with pride over completing the first test, hm? As I told you before, it's no large feat. You should try your hand at boar hunting."},
    [3582]={name="Acidproof Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Recipe For Death'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Apothecary Renferrel in Silverpine Forest. Objective: Bring 6 samples of Lake Creeper Moss, 6 samples of Lake Skulker Moss and a Hardened Tumor to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity.",zone="Silverpine Forest",questName="A Recipe For Death",lore="According to Berard's Journal the moss from Lake Skulkers and Creepers might prove useful for our quest to brew a new plague. Those beasts dwell on the islands in Lake Lordamere to the east."},
    [3585]={name="Camouflaged Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=22,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Weaver'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Shadow Priest Allister in Silverpine Forest. Objective: Kill the Dalaran archmage, then retrieve his staff for Shadow Priest Allister at the Sepulcher.",zone="Silverpine Forest",questName="The Weaver",lore="An archmage of great power is overseeing the reactivation of the ley energy node. With the progress they have made, our only hope of stopping them is by killing him."},
    [3586]={name="Logsplitter",quality=2,ilvl=16,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Arugal's Folly'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Dalar Dawnweaver in Silverpine Forest. Objective: Bring 6 Worgen Bits to Dalar Dawnweaver in The Sepulcher.",zone="Silverpine Forest",questName="Arugal's Folly",lore="As my understanding of Arugal's magic grows so does my disdain for the hapless fool. I am close to completing my research on his so called remedy."},
