    [6720]={name="Spirit Hunter Headdress",quality=2,ilvl=37,reqLevel=26,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Frostmaw'. Starts with Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Bring Frostmaw's Mane to Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Frostmaw",lore="it is now time for you to travel to far-off lands. You are ready. You now hunt Frostmaw, a yeti in the Alterac Mountains. He is elusive, his white coat blending into the snows of his mountain home."},
    [6721]={name="Chestplate of Kor",quality=2,ilvl=24,reqLevel=19,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Supplies to Auberdine'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Feero Ironhand in Ashenvale. Objective: Speak with Delgren the Purifier at Maestra's Post after seeing Feero safely through Ashenvale Forest.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Supplies to Auberdine",lore="Delgren has asked me to deliver messages and supplies to Sentinel Starbreeze in Auberdine, but I am loathe to leave on my own."},
    [6722]={name="Beastial Manacles",quality=2,ilvl=30,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Fallen Sky Lake'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Pelturas Whitemoon in Ashenvale. Objective: Retrieve a Fallen Moonstone from the Shadethicket Oracle, then bring it to Pelturas in Astranaar.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Fallen Sky Lake",lore="Relara's fever has passed, but she is still very weak. I do not believe time alone will give her back the strength she has lost. I believe it will take the power of a moonstone."},
    [6723]={name="Medal of Courage",quality=2,ilvl=47,reqLevel=35,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Saving Yenniku'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Kin'weelay in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Bring the Filled Soul Gem to Nimboya.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Saving Yenniku",lore="I have reshaped the Mind's Eye into a Soul Gem. Its purpose is twofold: you must use it to stun Yenniku, and once stunned place it upon his head to entrap his soul."},
    [6725]={name="Marbled Buckler",quality=3,ilvl=36,reqLevel=29,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Crone of the Kraul'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="The Crone of the Kraul",lore="Poor Heralath! And this dwarf... Lonebrow. What a brave soul he was. We must not let their valiance go for naught. This crone... Charlga Razorflank..."},
    [6726]={name="Razzeric's Customized Seatbelt",quality=2,ilvl=41,reqLevel=29,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Safety First'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Shreev in Thousand Needles. Objective: Return the Modified Seaforium Booster to Razzeric on the Shimmering Flats.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Safety First",lore="There, I did what Razzeric wanted. Just tell him to be careful when he sets this off. If he makes the slightest mistake, he won't be moving forward, he'll just be a burnt spot on the track."},
    [6730]={name="Ironforge Chain",quality=2,ilvl=16,reqLevel=11,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 80).",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [6731]={name="Ironforge Breastplate",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=15,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 100). Reward from the quest \"Gearing Redridge\".",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [6732]={name="Gnomish Mechanic's Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=38,reqLevel=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'News for Fizzle'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Martek the Exiled in Thousand Needles. Objective: Speak with Fizzle Brassbolts in the Shimmering Flats.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="News for Fizzle",lore="Indurium has an amazing resistance to heat! I'm sure it will work for Fizzle's pistons. But he'll need true indurium ore, not just the flakes."},
    [6733]={name="Ironforge Gauntlets",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=23,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 140).",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [6738]={name="Bleeding Crescent",quality=2,ilvl=35,reqLevel=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Parts of the Swarm'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Korran in Orgrimmar. Objective: Return to Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Parts of the Swarm",lore="Head back to Belgrom in Orgrimmar and tell him Moktar be doing his bidding well out in the Thousand Needles. Tell him also, that me studies progress, and I hope to be havin' learned more soon.",proc="Chance on hit: Wounds the target causing them to bleed for 85 damage over 30 sec."},
    [6740]={name="Azure Sash",quality=2,ilvl=29,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Sacred Flame'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Rau Cliffrunner in Thousand Needles. Objective: Retrieve the Cloven Hoof for Rau Cliffrunner at the Freewind Post.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="The Sacred Flame",lore="Using the water you brought, you will be able to temporarily douse the flame that holds the centaur relic. It will not work permanently, however, so you will have to be quick about it."},
    [6741]={name="Orcish War Sword",quality=1,ilvl=29,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A New Ore Sample'. Starts with Tatternack Steelforge in The Barrens. Objective: Find an Unrefined Ore Sample on a Gravelsnout Digger or Surveyor and bring it to Tatternack Steelforge at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="A New Ore Sample",lore="you have done well in helping me in the past. The warchief is pleased thus far with what I've accomplished, and asks me to continue with renewed determination."},
    [6742]={name="Stonefist Girdle",quality=3,ilvl=36,reqLevel=29,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Crone of the Kraul'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="The Crone of the Kraul",lore="Poor Heralath! And this dwarf... Lonebrow. What a brave soul he was. We must not let their valiance go for naught. This crone... Charlga Razorflank..."},
    [6743]={name="Sustaining Ring",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Knowledge in the Deeps'. Starts with Gerrig Bonegrip in Ironforge. Objective: Bring the Lorgalis Manuscript to Gerrig Bonegrip in the Forlorn Cavern in Ironforge.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Knowledge in the Deeps",lore="As you might know, I collect lore. Old lore. Powerful lore. Lore that opens doorways, and lore that can awaken Those Who Sleep."},
    [6746]={name="Basalt Buckler",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Corrupter'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Takata Steelblade in Desolace. Objective: Slay Lord Azrethoc and Jugkar Grim'rod and return to Takata Steelblade in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="The Corrupter",lore="Although I have no knowledge of this Lord Azrethoc, I agree with Maurin, he must be stopped; especially if he is attempting to gain influence over the Burning Blade to further his goals."},
    [6747]={name="Enforcer Pauldrons",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Corrupter'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Takata Steelblade in Desolace. Objective: Slay Lord Azrethoc and Jugkar Grim'rod and return to Takata Steelblade in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="The Corrupter",lore="Although I have no knowledge of this Lord Azrethoc, I agree with Maurin, he must be stopped; especially if he is attempting to gain influence over the Burning Blade to further his goals."},
    [6749]={name="Tiger Band",quality=2,ilvl=32,reqLevel=22,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Willix the Importer'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="Willix the Importer",lore="At last, help has arrived! You have no clue how long I've been held prisoner here. I can't remember the last time I saw the outside of this place."},
    [6750]={name="Snake Hoop",quality=2,ilvl=32,reqLevel=22,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Willix the Importer'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="Willix the Importer",lore="At last, help has arrived! You have no clue how long I've been held prisoner here. I can't remember the last time I saw the outside of this place."},
    [6751]={name="Mourning Shawl",quality=2,ilvl=32,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mortality Wanes'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="Mortality Wanes",lore="I have not long to live... so... so... weak....the b-b-brave dwarf, Lonebrow, has been sent to w-w-warn Falfindel... But before I... d-d-die......my wife, Treshala..."},
    [6757]={name="Jaina's Signet Ring",quality=2,ilvl=38,reqLevel=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Missing Diplomat'. Starts with Tapoke \\\"Slim\\\" Jahn in Wetlands. Objective: Speak to Mikhail in the Wetlands.",zone="Stormwind City",questName="The Missing Diplomat"},
    [6773]={name="Kolkar Marauder Chain",quality=2,ilvl=42,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Khan Hratha'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Uthek the Wise in Desolace. Objective: Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and bring the Maraudine Key Fragment to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village.",zone="Desolace",questName="Khan Hratha",lore="you helped us against the Magram. Now, help us beat the Maraudine! Kill the head of their clan, Khan Hratha! To face him, blow the Maraudine War Horn."},
    [6774]={name="Traitor's Finger",quality=2,ilvl=42,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Khan Hratha'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Uthek the Wise in Desolace. Objective: Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and bring the Maraudine Key Fragment to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village.",zone="Desolace",questName="Khan Hratha",lore="you helped us against the Magram. Now, help us beat the Maraudine! Kill the head of their clan, Khan Hratha! To face him, blow the Maraudine War Horn."},
    [6792]={name="Sanguine Pauldrons",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Karnitol Shipwreck'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Desolace. Objective: Return to Kreldig Ungor in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="The Karnitol Shipwreck",lore="Take Karnitol's things back to Roetten in Ironforge and he'll pay you for a job well done. Haha, if you're not careful, he's gonna be so pleased with ya that he'll ask you to join us full time."},
    [6793]={name="Auric Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Reagents for Reclaimers Inc.'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Kreldig Ungor in Ironforge. Objective: Bring Leftwitch's Package back to Roetten Stonehammer in Ironforge.",zone="Desolace",questName="Reagents for Reclaimers Inc.",lore="To get paid, you're gonna have to get back to Ironforge and speak to Roetten himself. He'll love getting Leftwitch's package out of the way anyway."},
    [6802]={name="Sword of Omen",quality=3,ilvl=44,reqLevel=33,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Into The Scarlet Monastery'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Scarlet Monastery",questName="Into The Scarlet Monastery",lore="Whilst the Dark Lady tends to the pressing issue of the Lich King's advance to the north, I am seeing to it that matters closer to home are being taken care of accordingly."},
    [6803]={name="Prophetic Cane",quality=3,ilvl=44,reqLevel=33,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Into The Scarlet Monastery'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Scarlet Monastery",questName="Into The Scarlet Monastery",lore="Whilst the Dark Lady tends to the pressing issue of the Lich King's advance to the north, I am seeing to it that matters closer to home are being taken care of accordingly."},
    [6828]={name="Visionary Buckler",quality=2,ilvl=38,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Galen's Escape'. Starts with Galen Goodward in Swamp of Sorrows. Objective: Escort Galen out of danger, then find his camp in the Swamp of Sorrows and open his strongbox.",zone="Swamp of Sorrows",questName="Galen's Escape",lore="Please help! These creatures are going to eat me! Help me out of here, and I'll give you a great treasure! It's in my camp in the swamp north of Stonard, but it's locked in a strongbox that can be opened through a trick that only I know."},
    [6829]={name="Sword of Serenity",quality=3,ilvl=44,reqLevel=34,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'In the Name of the Light'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Raleigh the Devout in Scarlet Monastery. Objective: Kill High Inquisitor Whitemane, Scarlet Commander Mograine, Herod, the Scarlet Champion and Houndmaster Loksey and then report back to Raleigh the Devout in Southshore.",zone="Scarlet Monastery",questName="In the Name of the Light",lore="I once served the Scarlet Crusade with honor, loyalty and pride. I believed their cause to be a noble one: to rid Azeroth of the undead."},
    [6830]={name="Bonebiter",quality=3,ilvl=44,reqLevel=34,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'In the Name of the Light'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Raleigh the Devout in Scarlet Monastery. Objective: Kill High Inquisitor Whitemane, Scarlet Commander Mograine, Herod, the Scarlet Champion and Houndmaster Loksey and then report back to Raleigh the Devout in Southshore.",zone="Scarlet Monastery",questName="In the Name of the Light",lore="I once served the Scarlet Crusade with honor, loyalty and pride. I believed their cause to be a noble one: to rid Azeroth of the undead."},
    [6834]={name="Black Tuxedo",quality=1,ilvl=1,sourceType="object_drop",instructions="Found in a container.",npc="a container"},
    [6901]={name="Glowing Thresher Cape",quality=3,ilvl=29,reqLevel=24,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Old Serra'kis.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Old Serra'kis"},
    [6902]={name="Bands of Serra'kis",quality=3,ilvl=27,reqLevel=22,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Old Serra'kis.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Old Serra'kis",lore="Serra'kis is the great water beast the naga breed in the flooded halls of Blackfathom Deeps, and the reason the lower temple is under water at all."},
    [6903]={name="Gaze Dreamer Pants",quality=3,ilvl=28,reqLevel=23,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Twilight Lord Kelris.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Twilight Lord Kelris"},
    [6905]={name="Reef Axe",quality=3,ilvl=27,reqLevel=22,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Gelihast.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Gelihast"},
    [6906]={name="Algae Fists",quality=3,ilvl=28,reqLevel=23,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Gelihast.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Gelihast"},
    [6907]={name="Tortoise Armor",quality=3,ilvl=27,reqLevel=22,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ghamoo-ra.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Ghamoo-ra"},
    [6908]={name="Ghamoo-ra's Bind",quality=3,ilvl=27,reqLevel=22,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ghamoo-ra.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Ghamoo-ra",lore="Ghamoo-ra is the ancient turtle the naga keep in Blackfathom Deeps -- old enough that the Twilight cultists there treat it as part of the temple."},
    [6909]={name="Strike of the Hydra",quality=3,ilvl=31,reqLevel=26,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Aku'mai.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Aku'mai",proc="Chance on hit: Inflict 42 Fire and 14 Frost damage, slow the target by 50% for 5 sec, reduce armor by 50, and inflict 7 Nature damage every 3 sec for 12 sec."},
    [6910]={name="Leech Pants",quality=3,ilvl=29,reqLevel=24,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Aku'mai.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Aku'mai"},
    [6911]={name="Moss Cinch",quality=3,ilvl=30,reqLevel=25,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Aku'mai.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Aku'mai"},
    [6953]={name="Verigan's Fist",quality=3,ilvl=31,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Test of Righteousness'. Starts with Jordan Stilwell in Dun Morogh. Objective: Wait for Jordan Stilwell to finish forging a weapon for you.",zone="Dun Morogh",questName="The Test of Righteousness",lore="Why don't we go over to the forge and get started on this? I've been preparing for your arrival for some time, so it shouldn't take long at all.",proc="Chance on hit: Ignite the target in the flames of the Great Forge, dealing 39 to 59 Holyfire damage. Deals 3 times as much damage to Fire Elementals and Earth Elementals."},
    [6998]={name="Nimbus Boots",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Twilight Falls'. Starts with Argent Guard Manados in Darnassus. Objective: Bring 10 Twilight Pendants to Argent Guard Manados in Darnassus.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Twilight Falls",lore="Empowered by the ancient rites of the chaotic Old Gods the members of the Twilight's Hammer strive to bring about the return of their dark patrons and spread death and terror across the world."},
    [7000]={name="Heartwood Girdle",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Twilight Falls'. Starts with Argent Guard Manados in Darnassus. Objective: Bring 10 Twilight Pendants to Argent Guard Manados in Darnassus.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Twilight Falls",lore="Empowered by the ancient rites of the chaotic Old Gods the members of the Twilight's Hammer strive to bring about the return of their dark patrons and spread death and terror across the world."},
    [7002]={name="Arctic Buckler",quality=3,ilvl=29,reqLevel=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Blackfathom Villainy'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Blackfathom Villainy",lore="Strength has left me. Your help is needed! Long ago this site was a great temple of Elune. But misfortune led to ruin when the corruption of an Old God seeped up from beneath the earth and tainted the sacred Moon Well."},
    [7003]={name="Beetle Clasps",quality=2,ilvl=26,reqLevel=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Researching the Corruption'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gershala Nightwhisper in Darkshore. Objective: Gershala Nightwhisper in Auberdine wants 8 Corrupt Brain stems.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Researching the Corruption",lore="Foolish blood elves toil with demonic magic. Have they not witnessed what happened with the naga and with the satyrs of Kalimdor? I fear that the blood elves will meet a similar deformation."},
    [7004]={name="Prelacy Cape",quality=2,ilvl=26,reqLevel=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Researching the Corruption'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gershala Nightwhisper in Darkshore. Objective: Gershala Nightwhisper in Auberdine wants 8 Corrupt Brain stems.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Researching the Corruption",lore="Foolish blood elves toil with demonic magic. Have they not witnessed what happened with the naga and with the satyrs of Kalimdor? I fear that the blood elves will meet a similar deformation."},
