    [11854]={name="Samophlange Screwdriver",quality=2,ilvl=19,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Samophlange Manual'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Rilli Greasygob in Orgrimmar. Objective: Bring the Samophlange Manual to Rilli Greasygob in Orgrimmar.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Samophlange Manual",lore="I think I can fix the samophlange, but I'm going to need the user's manual first."},
    [11855]={name="Tork Wrench",quality=2,ilvl=19,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Samophlange Manual'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Rilli Greasygob in Orgrimmar. Objective: Bring the Samophlange Manual to Rilli Greasygob in Orgrimmar.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Samophlange Manual",lore="I think I can fix the samophlange, but I'm going to need the user's manual first."},
    [11858]={name="Battlehard Cape",quality=2,ilvl=45,reqLevel=37,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Grim Discovery'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Krueg Skullsplitter in Orgrimmar. Objective: Bring the Crate of Grimtotem Horns to Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar.",zone="Feralas",questName="A Grim Discovery",lore="What?! Ah, so I did mention a bounty, didn't I? Well, that'll teach me to open my mouth, won't it? You did the work, so I suppose it is only right you reap the greatest reward from it."},
    [11864]={name="White Bone Spear",quality=2,ilvl=52,reqLevel=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bone-Bladed Weapons'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Bone-Bladed Weapons",lore="In Un'Goro Crater there be raptors with deadly claws. Some of those raptors sometimes have white claws instead of ones black like death."},
    [11872]={name="Eschewal Greaves",quality=2,ilvl=54,reqLevel=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Calm Before the Storm'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gracina Spiritmight in Darnassus. Objective: Bring the Bank Voucher to Idriana in the bank of Darnassus.",zone="Darnassus",questName="Calm Before the Storm",lore="your help has been immeasurable. The time will come, no doubt, when I'll ask for your assistance against the silithid once more.",proc="Equip: Increases your chance to Dodge an attack by 1.0%."},
    [11882]={name="Outrider Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=56,reqLevel=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Bait for Lar'korwi'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Torwa Pathfinder in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Using the contents of Torwa's Pouch, summon Lar'korwi and defeat him. Then bring Lar'korwi's Head to Torwa Pathfinder near the entrance to Un'Goro Crater.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="The Bait for Lar'korwi",lore="This will be the most difficult part because there is some complexity to the plan. To the north of here, you will find a small trail into the mountains."},
    [11884]={name="Moonlit Amice",quality=2,ilvl=33,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Vahlarriel'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Desolace",questName="Return to Vahlarriel",lore="So, the time is now then? I appreciate your efforts, and if the situation does not lend itself, then allow me to thank you now for everything you've done for me and my family."},
    [11902]={name="Linken's Sword of Mastery",quality=3,ilvl=56,reqLevel=47,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'It's Dangerous to Go Alone'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Linken in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Travel to Fire Plume Ridge, south of Marshal's Refuge.Find Blazerunner and use the totem to remove his protective aura. Once he has been defeated, acquire the Golden Flame from the cave.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="It's Dangerous to Go Alone",lore="I finally remember now... I did come here to fight Blazerunner. I was on a journey, and this was to be the last step. But I am no longer the hero...",proc="Chance on hit: Blasts a target for 74 to 123 Nature damage."},
    [11904]={name="Spirit of Aquementas",quality=3,ilvl=56,reqLevel=47,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'It's Dangerous to Go Alone'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Linken in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Travel to Fire Plume Ridge, south of Marshal's Refuge.Find Blazerunner and use the totem to remove his protective aura. Once he has been defeated, acquire the Golden Flame from the cave.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="It's Dangerous to Go Alone",lore="I finally remember now... I did come here to fight Blazerunner. I was on a journey, and this was to be the last step. But I am no longer the hero..."},
    [11907]={name="Beastslayer",quality=2,ilvl=55,reqLevel=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Mighty U'cha'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Torwa Pathfinder in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Bring U'cha's Pelt to Torwa Pathfinder at the entrance of Un'Goro Crater.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="The Mighty U'cha",lore="While you have been exploring Un'Goro, I have seen other things that a mighty hunter such as yourself would relish in. One such sight was a huge ape among the other gorillas to the north."},
    [11910]={name="Bejeweled Legguards",quality=2,ilvl=55,reqLevel=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Little Help From My Friends'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ringo in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Lead Ringo to Spraggle Frock at Marshal's Refuge.If Ringo faints, use Spraggle's Canteen to revive him.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="A Little Help From My Friends",lore="Ugh... It's so hot... I was exploring this area, when all of a sudden, the heat just became unbearable. I must be suffering from heat exhaustion.",proc="Equip: Increases your chance to Dodge an attack by 1.0%."},
    [11915]={name="Shizzle's Drizzle Blocker",quality=2,ilvl=55,reqLevel=49,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Shizzle's Flyer'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Collect 8 Webbed Diemetradon Scales and 8 Webbed Pterrordax Scales for Shizzle in Marshal's Refuge.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="Shizzle's Flyer",lore="I'm making a flying machine! I got stranded here, and I'm absolutely horrible at finding my way around. I'd take a gryphon or wind rider back to Gadgetzan, but those beasts just scare me to death."},
    [11918]={name="Grotslab Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=55,reqLevel=49,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Beware of Pterrordax'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Kill 10 Pterrordax and 15 Frenzied Pterrordax, then speak to Spraggle Frock at Marshal's Refuge.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="Beware of Pterrordax",lore="Wanted: A skilled fighter to deal with the threat of the Pterrordax that inhabit the Un'Goro Crater. Their numbers are growing, and they are becoming a menace to travelers in the area."},
    [11919]={name="Cragplate Greaves",quality=2,ilvl=55,reqLevel=49,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Beware of Pterrordax'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Kill 10 Pterrordax and 15 Frenzied Pterrordax, then speak to Spraggle Frock at Marshal's Refuge.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="Beware of Pterrordax",lore="Wanted: A skilled fighter to deal with the threat of the Pterrordax that inhabit the Un'Goro Crater. Their numbers are growing, and they are becoming a menace to travelers in the area."},
