    [21188]={name="Fist of Cenarius",quality=4,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Champion's Battlegear'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vargus in Silithus. Objective: Bring 15 Cenarion Combat Badges, 20 Cenarion Logistics Badges, 20 Cenarion Tactical Badges and 1 Mark of Cenarius to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",zone="Silithus",questName="Champion's Battlegear",lore="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 2.0%."},
    [21196]={name="Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight",quality=4,ilvl=60,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Path of the Protector'.",zone="Tanaris",questName="The Path of the Protector"},
    [21206]={name="Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight",quality=4,ilvl=60,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Path of the Invoker'.",zone="Tanaris",questName="The Path of the Invoker"},
    [21312]={name="Belt of the Den Watcher",quality=2,ilvl=48,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Timbermaw Ally'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Felwood. Objective: Grazle wants you to prove yourself by killing 5 Deadwood Warriors, 5 Deadwood Pathfinders, and 5 Deadwood Gardeners.",zone="Felwood",questName="Timbermaw Ally",lore="The Timbermaw are the only furbolg tribe to escape the corruption. However, many other races kill furbolg blindly now, without bothering to see if they are friend or foe."},
    [21316]={name="Leggings of the Ursa",quality=2,ilvl=55,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Deadwood of the North'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Felwood",questName="Deadwood of the North",lore="There is a camp of Deadwood furbolgs directly to our southwest. Corruption permeates the camp, and I wish to put an end to it before they become a problem.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [21318]={name="Earth Warder's Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=58,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Winterfall Activity'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Salfa in Winterspring. Objective: Salfa wants you to kill 8 Winterfall Shaman, 8 Winterfall Den Watchers, and 8 Winterfall Ursa. Salfa is located just outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold in Winterspring.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Winterfall Activity",lore="The Timbermaw tend to stay to themselves. While we do allow safe passage to those we trust, we try to avoid other furbolg tribes if at all possible."},
    [21319]={name="Gloves of the Pathfinder",quality=2,ilvl=58,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Winterfall Activity'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Salfa in Winterspring. Objective: Salfa wants you to kill 8 Winterfall Shaman, 8 Winterfall Den Watchers, and 8 Winterfall Ursa. Salfa is located just outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold in Winterspring.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Winterfall Activity",lore="The Timbermaw tend to stay to themselves. While we do allow safe passage to those we trust, we try to avoid other furbolg tribes if at all possible."},
    [21320]={name="Vest of the Den Watcher",quality=2,ilvl=58,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Winterfall Activity'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Salfa in Winterspring. Objective: Salfa wants you to kill 8 Winterfall Shaman, 8 Winterfall Den Watchers, and 8 Winterfall Ursa. Salfa is located just outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold in Winterspring.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Winterfall Activity",lore="The Timbermaw tend to stay to themselves. While we do allow safe passage to those we trust, we try to avoid other furbolg tribes if at all possible."},
    [21322]={name="Ursa's Embrace",quality=2,ilvl=58,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Winterfall Activity'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Salfa in Winterspring. Objective: Salfa wants you to kill 8 Winterfall Shaman, 8 Winterfall Den Watchers, and 8 Winterfall Ursa. Salfa is located just outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold in Winterspring.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Winterfall Activity",lore="The Timbermaw tend to stay to themselves. While we do allow safe passage to those we trust, we try to avoid other furbolg tribes if at all possible."},
    [21531]={name="Drake Tooth Necklace",quality=4,ilvl=77,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Nightmare Manifests'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Keeper Remulos in Moonglade. Objective: Defend Nighthaven from Eranikus. Do not let Keeper Remulos perish. Do not slay Eranikus. Defend yourself. Await Tyrande.",zone="Moonglade",questName="The Nightmare Manifests",lore="We must use restraint against Eranikus. We are to redeem him not destroy him. Tyrande is already en route to assist us in this task. We must weather the dragon's blows and save Nighthaven from certain destruction."},
    [21567]={name="Rune of Duty",quality=3,ilvl=45,reqLevel=40,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Illiyana Moonblaze in Silverwing Sentinels (Alliance) or Kelm Hargunth in Warsong Outriders (Horde). Alliance: Illiyana Moonblaze at Silverwing Grove, Ashenvale. Horde: Kelm Hargunth at Mor'shan Base Camp, The Barrens."},
    [21568]={name="Rune of Duty",quality=3,ilvl=25,reqLevel=20,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Illiyana Moonblaze in Silverwing Sentinels (Alliance) or Kelm Hargunth in Warsong Outriders (Horde). Alliance: Illiyana Moonblaze at Silverwing Grove, Ashenvale. Horde: Kelm Hargunth at Mor'shan Base Camp, The Barrens."},
    [21836]={name="Ritssyn's Ring of Chaos",quality=4,ilvl=71,reqLevel=60,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Vekniss Soldier.",zone="Silithus",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [22086]={name="Soulforge Belt",quality=3,ilvl=65,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Just Compensation'. Starts with Mokvar in Orgrimmar. Objective: Bring a Shadowcraft Belt and a set of Shadowcraft Gloves to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",setPiece=true,zone="Ironforge",questName="Just Compensation",lore="I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin. Bring me the belt and set of gauntlets that you wish to upgrade."},
    [22087]={name="Soulforge Boots",quality=4,ilvl=60,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Anthion's Parting Words'. Objective: Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Dreadmist Sandals, Dreadmist Leggings and Dreadmist Mantle.",setPiece=true,zone="Ironforge",questName="Anthion's Parting Words",lore="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us. The only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together."},
    [22088]={name="Soulforge Bracers",quality=3,ilvl=65,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'An Earnest Proposition'. Starts with Deliana in Ironforge. Objective: Acquire 15 Winterspring Blood Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Lightforge Bracers to Deliana in Ironforge.",setPiece=true,zone="Ironforge",questName="An Earnest Proposition",lore="I have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality. I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor."},
    [22089]={name="Soulforge Breastplate",quality=4,ilvl=60,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Saving the Best for Last'. Starts with Deliana in Ironforge. Objective: Give Deliana your Helm of Valor and Breastplate of Valor.",setPiece=true,zone="Ironforge",questName="Saving the Best for Last",lore="That's an amazing story! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [22090]={name="Soulforge Gauntlets",quality=4,ilvl=55,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Just Compensation'. Starts with Mokvar in Orgrimmar. Objective: Bring a Shadowcraft Belt and a set of Shadowcraft Gloves to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",setPiece=true,zone="Ironforge",questName="Just Compensation",lore="I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin. Bring me the belt and set of gauntlets that you wish to upgrade.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [22091]={name="Soulforge Helm",quality=4,ilvl=60,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Saving the Best for Last'. Starts with Deliana in Ironforge. Objective: Give Deliana your Helm of Valor and Breastplate of Valor.",setPiece=true,zone="Ironforge",questName="Saving the Best for Last",lore="That's an amazing story! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [22092]={name="Soulforge Legplates",quality=3,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Anthion's Parting Words'. Objective: Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Dreadmist Sandals, Dreadmist Leggings and Dreadmist Mantle.",setPiece=true,zone="Ironforge",questName="Anthion's Parting Words",lore="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us. The only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together."},
    [22093]={name="Soulforge Spaulders",quality=3,ilvl=65,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Anthion's Parting Words'. Objective: Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Dreadmist Sandals, Dreadmist Leggings and Dreadmist Mantle.",setPiece=true,zone="Ironforge",questName="Anthion's Parting Words",lore="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us. The only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together."},
    [22149]={name="Beads of Ogre Mojo",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=58,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Falrin's Vendetta'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Falrin Treeshaper in Dire Maul. Objective: Collect 25 Ogre Warbeads from Ogres inside Dire Maul or Blackrock Spire and return to Falrin Treeshaper inside the Athenaeum in Dire Maul.",zone="Dire Maul",questName="Falrin's Vendetta",lore="Yet I'm not one to give out favors freely, even if you were sent here by an old friend. I hold nothing but hatred and contempt for our brutish ogre neighbors."},
